Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:51:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: trusted-firmware-a: not by default for the Skyworth
 GN630V

The GN630V keeps its vendor bootloader, so it needs none of the EN7523 TF-A images (whose host build also needs a Linux-only toolchain).
